{"title":"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_25\">Problem 25</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 25\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of all numbers of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/1/8212d53cc8b0168515655f3f98d713a8e332ee65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2k + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> takes on integral values from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/f/68f46a78aefcd5e77e2e1d767cb32dba34d3a2cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ n^2\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ n(n+1)\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ n(n+2)\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ (n+1)^2\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ (n+1)(n+2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"631\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the odd integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2ddf6ad8f62b8238362e0836a655735c56810856.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2k-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/0/6006bba637eef443381fbaff768fa62d9ff41e62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" />. However, in this problem, the sum is instead <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f2789508227865dfc89fd46e18ae9b25bff34257.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />, starting at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> rather than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. To rewrite this, we note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2ddf6ad8f62b8238362e0836a655735c56810856.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2k-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f2789508227865dfc89fd46e18ae9b25bff34257.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> for every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> we add, so for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />'s, we subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f93f5c51ea4b04b4992b003b39479f29018f6bda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />, giving us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/c/0dc7a7dfb14b03fe242df31cfd2be509d5f54edf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2+2n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" />,which factors as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/11856b4a7a6b8adc22a631e31f86b86c6e1e20b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n(n+2) \\implies \\boxed{\\text{(C)} n(n+2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"220\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME\" title=\"1956 AHSME\">1956 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1956 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1956\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017161833\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 173/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3754/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   18.057      1 -total\n 54.85%    9.905      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n 43.24%    7.808      1 Template:AHSME_box\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15578:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017161833 and revision id 85484. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n --